  id: preset-pyre
  displayName: Pyre Warden (Fire + Water)
  playstyle: elemental
  description: 'Objective: stack Burn, then cash it in. Ember Lash adds Burn from its own chart; Flame Guard adds Burn at every 15 Combo while defending. Pyre Keeper raises the cap. Undertow on a Burning enemy makes Steam (burst from the Burn stacks); Combust waits in reserve to detonate Burn directly.

    Trade-off: Burn is slow until it is detonated; Steam uses up both marks.'
